        289.06353759765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "an oval path. The red point describes the start point, and the green point",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        290.904296875,
        558.0016479492188,
        298.029541015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "indicates the goal point. The black line shows the reference trajectory,",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        299.8713073730469,
        558.0015869140625,
        306.9965515136719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and the gray rectangle is the obstacle. We use the ALP-MBD trained in",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        308.8373107910156,
        558.0016479492188,
        315.9625549316406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a different environment.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        317.8033142089844,
        391.522216796875,
        324.9285583496094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "VI. CONCLUSIONS",
      "bbox": [
        388.50201416015625,
        350.8233947753906,
        482.698486328125,
        359.7299499511719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        370.3724060058594,
        336.1941223144531,
        379.2789611816406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "introduced",
      "bbox": [
        345.0010681152344,
        370.3724060058594,
        387.6110534667969,
        379.2789611816406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Linear",
      "bbox": [
        396.40802001953125,
        370.3724060058594,
        422.410400390625,
        379.2789611816406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Path",
      "bbox": [
        431.21734619140625,
        370.3724060058594,
        448.7814025878906,
        379.2789611816406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Model-Based",
      "bbox": [
        457.578369140625,
        370.3724060058594,
        511.2568359375,
        379.2789611816406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Diffusion",
      "bbox": [
        520.0637817382812,
        370.3724060058594,
        558.0014038085938,
        379.2789611816406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(LP-MBD) and its adaptive extension (ALP-MBD). LP-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        382.327392578125,
        558.0010375976562,
        391.23394775390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MBD replaces variance-preserving schedules with a flow-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        394.2823791503906,
        558.0009765625,
        403.1889343261719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "matching–inspired linear probability path, yielding a geo-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        406.2383728027344,
        558.0009155273438,
        415.1449279785156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "metrically interpretable and decoupled parameterization. This",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        418.193359375,
        558.0009155273438,
        427.09991455078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "not only reduces the burden of tuning but also provides",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        430.1483459472656,
        558.0009155273438,
        439.0549011230469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the structural stability necessary for reinforcement learn-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        442.10333251953125,
        558.0009155273438,
        451.0098876953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ing–based adaptation. Building on this foundation, ALP-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        454.0583190917969,
        558.0009155273438,
        462.9648742675781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MBD dynamically adjusts diffusion steps and noise levels",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        466.0133056640625,
        558.0009765625,
        474.91986083984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "in response to task complexity, balancing robustness and",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        477.96929931640625,
        558.0007934570312,
        486.8758544921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "efficiency. Through numerical examples, Brax benchmarks,",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        489.9242858886719,
        558.0010986328125,
        498.8308410644531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and mobile robot trajectory-tracking, we demonstrated that",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        501.8792724609375,
        558.0009765625,
        510.78582763671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "LP-MBD simplifies scheduling while retaining strong per-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        513.834228515625,
        558.0009765625,
        522.7407836914062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "formance, and that ALP-MBD further improves adaptability",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        525.7892456054688,
        558.0009765625,
        534.69580078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and real-time control capability.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        537.7442626953125,
        443.3712158203125,
        546.6508178710938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
